<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-26T20:40:34.465Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:40:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking Riyadh airport and targeting missile facilities and oil infrastructure, while Saudi air defenses have intercepted many drones and missiles. Saudi-led coalition forces have responded by destroying Houthi missile tunnels, launchers and storage sites in Yemen and by using a Maven-like AI system to locate Houthi missiles. Egypt's parliament has authorized military support for Saudi Arabia to help defend against these attacks. Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan have held rare talks with Iran as Houthi strikes continue. A French FREMM frigate shot down a ballistic missile near a Belgian minehunter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPWGZQYkpkZXFYZXFmZ2MzYjVXQ1JRUTFFU3FRS0lBMy1qV095bllLM0FUZ2ZLNlBrUmtROG11aHpOUkZ1cnlVb2E0ZllPQ1prZlgtSmltZG5rWXpFSWs2QnhEUlNvdkozYVkzbXFwbmFhdkJmTnYwMDZhaHdGR2hlVFdQQnlxNm1SQk9EWnN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOaFIxVXVVYl90WFZodTB6bHpqOWN3aktZSHNDYTlaM3I5S1FoeU14U1NRVE1mVTJtSDV3ZHk1cHRiWDh6elBNamVIeE5tN2VvRDEyWXBPT1dyNW5KSXFyaE5PVEFOS1NyQW1CNkVVblN6SW1PeVg3aHQxY3B6WmhHU3cxM0gtdTNRLTY1NWo0R284RzQtSmVtTnRxVnR6MTVkNWVsU3djY1d2SURPNmo0N05CUFJZekpIUklNTmRxazZHVTNrbEFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNWjdNYmZnaWVQdFZZV1pkS1NJSDVOQ0xsVUx4emUweThKZUVlajZUeFNRSjJkM3dIZ0k5V2pvdkR1VmxnOWxsUnBUdnpTUUtXVGlhS2RuV0dqSExIcEtJNWlOQWZndHdHTWgtdzBuTW9yU01fV3g1WjREMEhtWVcyenR1ckhpSFF4bDhhMUJMRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBKSDBxaldzb2NwUW1pZ